{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01670","headline":"杂曲歌辞 少年乐 · 李贺","name":"杂曲歌辞 少年乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳草落花如锦地，二十长游醉乡里。\n红缨不重白马骄，垂柳金丝香拂水。\n吴娥未笑花不开，绿鬓耸堕兰云起。\n陆郎倚醉牵罗袂，夺得宝钗金翡翠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}